    "detailed_description": "Terminate: Project X is a horror first-person shooter inspired by dystopian, violent and <br>grimdark themes. <br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Two difficulties, Hard and Nightmare<br></li><li> 6 Unique maps<br></li><li> Several types of special infected<br></li><li> Objectives<br><br>In the game the player is sent as an artificial intelligence robot to the recently <br>closed genetic engineering facility known as New Sapiens. After the COO of the <br>facility, Dr. Feller, announced that a new disease took over their genetically <br>enhanced human specimens, nasty rumors spread in the media. Majority of the <br>population were against experiments with humans to begin with. New Sapiens <br>took it a step further by carrying out research with newborn babies, which granted <br>the homo sapiens species the best properties of all animals combined: high IQ of <br>human, speed of cheetah, strength of gorilla, jump of spider\u2026 the hijacked list <br>continued.</li></ul>",
